---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Zcompressor vs Smallpdf - Unlimited Free Smallpdf Alternative | Compress PDF"
  description="Zcompressor aur Smallpdf ka comparison. Smallpdf ke 2 free files per day limit aur paid subscription traps ke mukable Zcompressor 100% free aur unlimited browser tool hai."
  ogUrl="https://zcompressor.com/hi/vs/smallpdf"
>
  <!-- JSON-LD FAQ Schema in Hinglish -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Smallpdf ke mukable Zcompressor free me kaisa hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Smallpdf free users ko din me sirf 2 documents compress karne deta hai aur uske baad paid plan lene ko majboor karta hai. Zcompressor 100% free hai, bina kisi daily limit ya restriction ke.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya Zcompressor me batch compression free hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Haan, Zcompressor me aap ek sath kitni bhi PDF files ko drag-drop karke free me compress kar sakte hain. Smallpdf me batch compression sirf Pro paid users ke liye hota hai.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  </script>

  <Header />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-canvas-soft text-ink py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
      <!-- Eyebrow & Title -->
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
        <span
          class="text-caption-mono font-mono text-link-deep dark:text-cyan-deep uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3 animate-fade-in"
        >
          Product Review
        </span>
        <h1
          class="text-display-lg md:text-display-xl text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-1.5px] md:tracking-[-2.4px] mb-4"
        >
          Zcompressor vs Smallpdf.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-body text-balance">
          Smallpdf ke daily limits aur paid plans ke mukable Zcompressor ka unlimited, 100% free local engine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Overview Section -->
      <section class="space-y-6 mb-12">
        <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
          Smallpdf ek popular PDF website hai, lekin unka free plan bahut limited hai. Free users din me sirf 2 files compress kar sakte hain, aur uske baad unhe mehnga subscription lene ke notification aane lagte hain.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
          Zcompressor me koi subscription model nahi hai. Ye developers aur users ke liye ek free browser utility hai jo aapke device par chal kar unlimited files compress karti hai.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Side-by-Side Comparison Table -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-6">
          Feature Comparison.
        </h2>
        <div class="border border-hairline rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-level-2 bg-canvas">
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-mute uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">Feature</th>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-ink font-semibold uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">Zcompressor</th>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-mute uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">Smallpdf</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Daily Free Tasks</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Unlimited (Hamesha Free)</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Sirf 2 documents / day</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Batch Compression</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Free me available</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Sirf Paid Pro Users ke liye</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Document Privacy</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">100% Client-Side (Zero Server Upload)</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Cloud Servers par Upload hoti hai</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Sign-in Requirement</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Koi account ya sign-in nahi</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Free tier me bar-bar prompt</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Deep Dive -->
      <section class="space-y-10 mb-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] mb-3">
            Bina Kisi Quota ke Unlimited Kaam Karein.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            Agar aapko form bharte waqt 5 ya 10 documents ek sath compress karne hain, to Smallpdf par aap 2 files ke baad atak jayenge. Zcompressor par aisi koi pareshani nahi hai—jitni marzi files compress karein aur ek click me ZIP download karein.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Call to Action -->
      <section class="border-t border-hairline pt-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink font-semibold mb-6">Unlimited free PDF compression shuru karein.</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/hi/compress-pdf"
            class="px-6 h-[48px] bg-primary text-on-primary text-button-lg rounded-pill hover:bg-black transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center shadow-level-3 hover:scale-[1.02] duration-200"
          >
            Compress Shuru Karein
          </a>
          <a
            href="/hi/vs"
            class="px-6 h-[48px] bg-canvas text-ink border border-hairline text-button-lg rounded-pill hover:bg-canvas-soft transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center shadow-level-2 hover:scale-[1.02] duration-200"
          >
            Dusre Comparisons Dekhein
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
